3: I won't let 'em get away, though!\c\nHer Purrloin...\nI'll get it back for sure!\c
4: So, [VAR TRNAME(0)]!\nKeep helping me out!\c\nAlso, continue to work hard\non the Pokédex!\c\nYou're the one who was officially\nasked to complete it, after all!\c
5: [VAR TRNAME(1)]: What?!\c\nIt isn't like I came here because\nI heard rumors about Cynthia\r\nbeing here and I wanted to challenge\r\nher or anything...\c\nI was interested in the Abyssal Ruins!\c\nSee! Here's proof! You can have it!\c
6: [VAR TRNAME(1)]: It's Dive!\c\nIf you have a Pokémon that knows it,\nyou can dive to the ocean floor.\c\nIf it wasn't for you, I wouldn't have\nfound my sister's Purrloin...\r\nOr should I say her Liepard...\c
