12: The Pokémon World Tournament...\nI wonder if Cynthia will participate, too.
13: Cynthia is participating in the\nPokémon World Tournament!\r\nI have to cheer for her!
14: The Riches moved far away,\nand it's a little bit lonelier around here.
15: The sunlight is strong...\c\nDepending on the Pokémon, that can be\neither an advantage or a disadvantage.\c\nStrong sunlight makes Fire-type moves\nstronger and Water-type moves weaker.
16: Yaaaay! Yaaay!\nUndella Town!!
